    "slug": "ai-overviews-cut-clicks-get-cited-fix",
    "title": "AI Overviews cut top clicks 58%. Get cited instead",
    "excerpt": "Ranking first is worth far less when Google answers above you. Being the source the answer cites is what still earns the click.",
    "category": "Content Strategy",
